          { p: `<strong>Picture this.</strong> You upload a product photo, attach the brand book, and ask for three Instagram captions in your tone. The same model does both jobs.` },
          { p: `<strong>Why it matters.</strong> Modern flagships like GPT-4o, Gemini, and Claude are multimodal. For brand teams this collapses several tools into one workflow.` },
